# Film 5 of still.fail in use on the iPhone Duo simulator, in English: a chat that came from Slack (someone there @'d the
# agent), its agent asking the viewer to decide: answered with one tap on the folded phone's outer screen; its fix goes
# back to the thread and its asker answers from Slack (story scripts/story/iduo-slack-en.json, FILM_LANG=en
# FILM_STORY=iduo-slack-en). It never unfolds.
timeout 45000
until Message
# (the film once the app is on the screen as it stays: its first frames, as it starts, are none of the story)
wait 1200
at start
# (the computer's Slack first: Ana's question there, the agent at work, its card for Lin coming in)
wait 6500
# (the list open over the chat as the outer screen lights: the chat from Slack at its top, tapped)
at tap=row
tap Checkout fails for EU cards
wait 900
# (shown beside the list, the list still in use: the chat tapped where it shows at the right, brought over)
at tap=chat
tapxy 430 330
wait 600
at read
until =Fix and deploy
wait 2200
at tap=deploy
tap =Fix and deploy
wait 600
at decided
until Fixed and live
at answer
wait 3000
until French card
at merged
wait 4200
at end
exit
